        "60. 数的四舍五入"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题. 如果1公斤糖果值1卢布48戈比，买100克这种",
        "糖果要付多少钱？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由于1公斤=1000克，因此100克=$\\frac{1}{10}$公斤。所以，为",
        "了求出答案需要用10去除1卢布48戈比："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1卢布48戈比:10=148戈比:10=$14\\frac{8}{10}$戈比=14.8戈比。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为戈比是最小的货币单位，所以无法付14.8戈比。应",
        "当付给整数戈比。因此，需要看答案的值接近于哪一个整数："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$14<14.8<15$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "14.8更接近于整数15，因为$15-14.8=0.2$，而$14.8-14=↵0.8$。也就是说，买100克糖果应当付15戈比。把14.8改"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
